# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "Configurer QCSC-Prefect sur un cluster Slurm {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ce guide prépare le nœud de connexion d'un cluster Slurm comme hôte de workflow de qcsc-prefect.\n"
"Le tutoriel SQD de qcsc-prefect part du résultat de ce guide.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Une fois ce guide terminé, tu disposes des éléments suivants :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Élément | Où | Contenu |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Nœud de connexion, l'hôte de workflow | Prefect, les packages qcsc-prefect et la commande `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Nœuds de calcul, dans les jobs Slurm | Le worker QRMI : QRMI avec sa commande `task_runner`, et `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | Le bloc qui nomme ton instance IBM Quantum&reg; et ton QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Nœud de connexion et nœuds de calcul | Ta clé API IBM Cloud&reg;, tes instances et tes Backends pour QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Exécute chaque commande dans un terminal sur le nœud de connexion, sauf indication contraire de l'étape.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prérequis {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
