"A Slurm cluster with OpenMPI, PMIx, and the QRMI SPANK plugin, which the cluster\n"
"administrator installs. The following guides describe these components:\n"
msgstr ""
"Un cluster Slurm avec OpenMPI, PMIx et le plugin SPANK QRMI, que l'administrateur\n"
"du cluster installe. Les guides suivants décrivent ces composants :\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"
msgstr "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin for QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"
msgstr "[Plugin SPANK pour QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin user guide](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"
msgstr "[Guide utilisateur du plugin SPANK](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A home directory and a work directory that the login node and the compute nodes see at\n"
"the same absolute paths\n"
msgstr ""
"Un répertoire personnel et un répertoire de travail que le nœud de connexion et les nœuds de calcul voient aux\n"
"mêmes chemins absolus\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS access to GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, and Prefect Cloud from the login\n"
"node, and to IBM Quantum from the compute nodes\n"
msgstr ""
"Un accès HTTPS sortant vers GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum et Prefect Cloud depuis le nœud de\n"
"connexion, et vers IBM Quantum depuis les nœuds de calcul\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Platform account with an IBM Cloud API key and at least one instance\n"
msgstr "Un compte IBM Quantum Platform avec une clé API IBM Cloud et au moins une instance\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Prefect Cloud account, or a Prefect server that you host\n"
msgstr "Un compte Prefect Cloud, ou un serveur Prefect que tu héberges\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Git, C and C++ compilers, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, and MPI on the cluster, for the solver\n"
"builds of the tutorial\n"
msgstr ""
"Git, des compilateurs C et C++, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK et MPI sur le cluster, pour les compilations des solveurs\n"
"du tutoriel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples use the Slurm partition `normal` and the compute nodes `c1` and `c2`. Replace\n"
"them with the names of your cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les exemples utilisent la partition Slurm `normal` et les nœuds de calcul `c1` et `c2`. Remplace-les\n"
"par les noms de ton cluster.\n"

