# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Log in to the login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"
msgstr "Étape 1 : se connecter au nœud de connexion {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install uv {#step-2-install-uv}"
msgstr "Étape 2 : installer uv {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "Installe le gestionnaire de packages [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), et vérifie l'installation :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Étape 3 : définir les chemins et créer le répertoire de travail {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Ce guide et les tutoriels utilisent deux variables d'environnement :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Variable | Exemple | Rôle |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | Le checkout de qcsc-prefect |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | Le répertoire de travail des jobs de solveur et des jobs QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les deux chemins doivent se trouver sur un stockage que les nœuds de calcul voient au même chemin absolu. Si\n"
"ton cluster n'a pas de répertoire `/shared`, choisis un autre chemin partagé.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Définis les variables et crée le répertoire de travail. Définis à nouveau les variables dans chaque nouveau\n"
"shell avant de suivre un tutoriel :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Pour définir automatiquement les variables dans chaque nouveau shell, ajoute-les à `~/.bashrc` :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Étape 4 : cloner qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "Clone le dépôt, puis place-toi sur un tag de version, par exemple `v0.3.1` :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Étape 5 : créer l'environnement du workflow {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Crée l'environnement du workflow avec Python 3.12, puis active-le :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"Installe les paquets qcsc-prefect. L'option `--no-deps` conserve les versions exactes épinglées\n"
"entre les paquets du checkout. Le tutoriel installe le workflow lui-même :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Vérifie que les commandes sont disponibles :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "Active `~/venv/qcsc-host` dans chaque nouveau shell du nœud de connexion.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Étape 6 : se connecter à Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Connecte-toi à Prefect Cloud. Choisis **Paste an API key**, colle une clé d'API Prefect Cloud, puis\n"
"choisis ton espace de travail :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Vérifie la connexion. La sortie affiche `PREFECT_API_URL` et ton espace de travail :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Facultatif : utilise ton propre serveur Prefect\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ignore cette note si tu utilises Prefect Cloud. Pour utiliser ton propre serveur Prefect à la place de Prefect\n"
"Cloud, suis\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"et indique l'adresse de ton serveur à la place de `<server-host>` :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Étape 7 : enregistrer les identifiants IBM Quantum {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Exécute `qcsc-qrmi login` après la connexion à Prefect, car cette commande enregistre le bloc `qrmi-runtime` :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Réponds aux invites :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Colle ta clé d'API IBM Cloud. La clé n'est pas affichée.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Appuie sur Entrée pour utiliser toutes les instances.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Saisis le numéro de l'instance par défaut, `1` dans l'exemple suivant.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saisis le numéro ou le nom du backend par défaut, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) dans l'exemple\n"
"suivant.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"La commande affiche aussi une note sur les nœuds de calcul et des lignes `[qrmi]` pour\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, que l'exemple omet (`...`). Tu n'as pas besoin des lignes `[qrmi]`,\n"
"car le workflow lit l'instance et le backend dans le bloc `qrmi-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "La commande `qcsc-qrmi` possède les sous-commandes suivantes :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Commande | Rôle |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Enregistre la clé d'API, les instances et les backends, puis sauvegarde le bloc |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Retrouve les instances et les backends avec la clé enregistrée |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Affiche les instances et les backends, sans la clé |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Vérifie que l'instance du bloc peut utiliser son backend |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Installer le fichier sur les nœuds de calcul {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le plugin SPANK lit `qrmi_config.json` sur chaque nœud de calcul, depuis le chemin indiqué dans\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, souvent `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Demande à l'administrateur de ton cluster d'\n"
"installer ton `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` à ce chemin. Installe-le de nouveau après chaque\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` ou `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Laisse **Session Mode** du bloc `qrmi-runtime` sur `batch`, car le plugin SPANK\n"
"acquiert la QPU en mode batch.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Étape 8 : créer l'environnement du nœud de calcul {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"Le worker QRMI s'exécute sur un nœud de calcul, dans son propre environnement. Crée-le à partir du même\n"
"checkout. L'option `--python` laisse `~/venv/qcsc-host` actif :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le paquet `qrmi[ibm]` fournit la commande `task_runner`. Le tutoriel ajoute le hook de compilation SQD\n"
"à cet environnement, et utilise `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` comme\n"
"`python_executable` de `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Étape 9 : vérifier la configuration {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Vérifie que le bloc `qrmi-runtime` existe :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Vérifie les instances et les backends enregistrés. La commande n'affiche jamais la clé :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Vérifie que l'instance par défaut peut utiliser le backend par défaut :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Vérifie que Slurm exécute un job sur les deux nœuds de calcul, également avec PMIx :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Vérifie l'environnement du nœud de calcul et le répertoire de travail sur un nœud de calcul. La première\n"
"commande n'affiche rien lorsque les imports réussissent :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Étapes suivantes {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommandations\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lis [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"pour choisir les nœuds, les rangs et les threads des jobs du solveur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"for the configuration file, the solvers, and the run parameters.\n"
